WEBVTT

00:05:29.952 --> 00:05:32.076
and projects it onto the silicon.

00:05:32.818 --> 00:05:35.562
But if you look at the structure
of an integrated circuit,

00:05:35.586 --> 00:05:37.560
the transistor arrays,

00:05:37.584 --> 00:05:41.213
many of the features are repeated
millions of times.

00:05:41.237 --> 00:05:43.845
It's a highly periodic structure.

00:05:44.331 --> 00:05:47.399
So we want to take advantage
of this periodicity

00:05:47.423 --> 00:05:50.120
in our alternative
manufacturing technique.

00:05:50.144 --> 00:05:53.579
We want to use self-assembling materials

00:05:53.603 --> 00:05:56.580
to naturally form the periodic structures

00:05:56.604 --> 00:05:58.987
that we need for our transistors.